<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-S2-011>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-S2-011" ;
  triage:title "Integration test spawns real atm-daemon binary — ADR-003 Tier 3 violation + no launch-lock" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/tests/run_daemon_production_path.rs:13 — integration test uses Command::new(daemon_bin) to spawn a real atm-daemon process. No Tier 3 ADR-003 classification attribute, no #[cfg(unix)] gate, no ADR-002 host-wide launch-lock acquisition before spawn. Violates ADR-003 (prohibited daemon spawn pattern in tests without explicit Tier 3 annotation) and ADR-002 (no singleton layer-1 guard)." ;
